<!-- Multi Champ Deluxe (ver. 1114, 14-11-1999) on TomSVR_esd, a personal MiSTer core for ESD's 16-bit boards, built on Jotego's JTFRAME.
     The ROM is assembled from your own MAME zip (merged set, current MAME names), unmodified. Requires TomSVR_esd.rbf. -->
